e, then leave me alone.\"","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"44:22","t":"And [finally] he called to his Lord that these were a criminal people.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"44:23","t":"[Allāh said], \"Then set out with My servants by night. Indeed, you are to be pursued.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"44:24","t":"And leave the sea in stillness. Indeed, they are an army to be drowned.\"","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"44:25","t":"How much they left behind of gardens and springs","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"44:26","t":"And crops and noble sites","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"44:27","t":"And comfort wherein they were amused.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"44:28","t":"Thus. And We caused to inherit it another people.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"44:29","t":"And the heaven and earth wept not for them, nor were they reprieved.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"44:30","t":"And We certainly saved the Children of Israel from the humiliating torment -","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"44:31","t":"From Pharaoh. Indeed, he was a haughty one among the transgressors.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"44:32","t":"And We certainly chose them by knowledge over [all] the worlds.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"44:33","t":"And We gave them of signs that in which there was a clear trial.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"44:34","t":"Indeed, these [disbelievers] are saying,","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"44:35","t":"\"There is not but our first death, and we will not be resurrected.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"44:36","t":"Then bring [back] our forefathers, if you should be truthful.\"","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"44:37","t":"Are they better or the people of Tubbaʿ and those before them? We destroyed them, [for] indeed, they were criminals.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"44:38","t":"And We did not create the heavens and earth and that between them in play.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"44:39","t":"We did not create them except in truth, but most of them do not know.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":39,"sd":null}],"juz":25,"hizb":50,"surahs":[44],"sajdah":false}